# in the internal archive, not the public tree.
*.py
scripts/gen_airwindows.ps1

# --- cymbals-ui kit MOVED: now project-owned at plugins/Cymbals/src/cymbals-ui ---
# It used to live at deps/cymbals-ui, which needed the negations that were here
# to pull it back out of the `deps/*
!deps/sst-effects/
!deps/sst-effects/**` rule above. It is no longer under deps/,
# so those negations are gone: the kit is plain first-party source in the
# plugin tree and needs no ignore gymnastics. `deps/*
!deps/sst-effects/
!deps/sst-effects/**` still excludes the
# submodules' working trees (their gitlinks are tracked regardless).

# Ad-hoc screenshot crops from UI triage (scratch, not documentation).
*_crop.png

# The Airwindows glue generator is kept in the local internal archive and is not
# part of the public build; committed generated tables remain the build input.
# (Its historical !-rules were removed so the local copy stays hidden.)